* An op-amp macromodel written for the tests of spice-net.js: a transconductance stage on a
* dominant pole, clamps a volt and a half inside the rails, a buffer and an output resistor.
.SUBCKT TESTAMP inp inn vcc vee out
Rin inp inn 2Meg
Cin inp inn 1.4p
G1 0 n1 inp inn 1m
R1 n1 0 100Meg
C1 n1 0 1.59n
D1 n1 vh DCLAMP
D2 vl n1 DCLAMP
Eh vh 0 VALUE={V(vcc)-2.1}
El vl 0 VALUE={V(vee)+2.1}
E2 n2 0 n1 0 1
Ro n2 out 75
.MODEL DCLAMP D(IS=1e-14)
.ENDS
